@startgantt
title Chronos Roadmap 2026
printscale weekly zoom 2

skinparam gantt {
    BarColor LightBlue
    BarBorderColor Blue
    GroupBackgroundColor LightGray
    GroupBorderColor DimGray
    MilestoneBackgroundColor Black
}

Project starts 2026-01-30

-- Phase 1: MVP (Q1) --
[Project Init] as [Init] lasts 1 week
[Init] is colored in Green
[Database Setup] as [DB] lasts 1 week
[DB] starts at [Init]'s end
[DB] is colored in Green
[Core API] as [API] lasts 2 weeks
[API] starts at [DB]'s end
[API] is colored in Green
[MVP Release] happens at [API]'s end

-- Phase 2: Advanced Features (Q2) --
[Complex Calculations] as [Calc] lasts 4 weeks
[Calc] starts at [API]'s end
[Calc] is colored in Orange
[Risk Analysis Module] as [Risk] lasts 4 weeks
[Risk] starts at [Calc]'s end
[Risk] is colored in Orange
[Interactive UI] as [UI] lasts 4 weeks
[UI] starts at [Risk]'s end
[UI] is colored in Orange

-- Phase 3: Scaling & Cloud (Q3) --
[Dockerization] as [Docker] lasts 2 weeks
[Docker] starts at [UI]'s end
[Docker] is colored in Purple
[K8s Integration] as [K8s] lasts 4 weeks
[K8s] starts at [Docker]'s end
[K8s] is colored in Purple
[Performance Tuning] as [Perf] lasts 6 weeks
[Perf] starts at [K8s]'s end
[Perf] is colored in Purple

-- Phase 4: Final Polish (Q4) --
[Security Audit] as [Sec] lasts 4 weeks
[Sec] starts at [Perf]'s end
[Sec] is colored in Red
[documentation] as [Docs] lasts 4 weeks
[Docs] starts at [Sec]'s end
[Docs] is colored in Red
[Final Release 1.0] happens at [Docs]'s end

@endgantt
